<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA SET 270 TO WIN SECOND TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA SET 270 TO WIN SECOND TEST.</headline>
<dateline>PORT ELIZABETH, South Africa 1997-03-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa were bowled out for 168 in their second innings on the third day of the second test on Sunday, leaving Australia with a 270-run victory target.</p>
<p>Scores:  South Africa 209 and 168, Australia 108</p>
</text>
